Note that this is the numerical model, hence we explicitly use hinv instead of 1/h and apply regularization. Also note that in the numerical model, the eigenvalues are ‘truncated’ in the sense that we return 0 eigenvalues for try cells.

model.flux() + model.hydrostatic_pressure()

